<title>UK: Inchcape forms financial services JV.</title>
<headline>Inchcape forms financial services JV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inchcape Plc, the distribution and car retailing group, said on Friday that it has formed a joint venture with NWS BANK Plc, a unit of Bank of Scotland, to provide car loan facilities and related services.</p>
</text>
